        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Arrival, The Town\n- People: Denis Villeneuve, Eric Heisserer, Ted Chiang, Amy Adams, Jeremy Renner, Forest Whitaker\n- Characters: Louise Banks\n- Organizations: U.S. Army\n- Topics: science fiction films, film adaptations, Academy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Ted Chiang wrote the short story \"Story of Your Life\" in 1998.\n- In 2010, Jeremy Renner was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor for his performance in \"The Town.\"\n- \"Arrival\" is a 2016 American science fiction film directed by Denis Villeneuve and written by Eric Heisserer.\n- \"Arrival\" is based on Ted Chiang's 1998 short story \"Story of Your Life.\"\n- \"Arrival\" stars Amy Adams, Jeremy Renner, and Forest Whitaker.\n- In \"Arrival,\" linguist Louise Banks is enlisted by the U.S. Army to help translate communications from one of several extraterrestrial craft that have appeared around the world.",
